# OpenBOM ignore file — reviewed findings to suppress (agent: --ignore FILE)
# Copy to .openbomignore (or any path) and keep entries short-lived.
#
# Format: VULN-ID [package-or-purl] [until=YYYY-MM-DD] [# reason]
#   VULN-ID  advisory id (GHSA-…, CVE-…, PYSEC-…) or a heuristic id (MALICIOUS_HEURISTIC, TYPOSQUAT_SUSPECT)
#   package  optional package name or purl; without it the id is suppressed for every package
#   until=   optional expiry; once past, the finding is reported (and fails CI) again
#
# Examples:
# GHSA-x84v-xcm2-53pg requests until=2026-12-31  # not reachable: proxy auth unused, ticket SEC-123
# MALICIOUS_HEURISTIC eventlet                   # reviewed: monkey-patches socket/ssl by design
# TYPOSQUAT_SUSPECT reqeusts                     # internal fork, reviewed by AppSec
